xaq WHOOP extension

The MCP server code in src/dashboard/ (mcp.ts, whoop.ts, health.ts, insights.ts, analysis.ts, stats.ts) is copied
verbatim from the WHOOP dashboard, https://github.com/wynn-dev/whoop-dashboard, directory src/lib, at commit
0518a3679fc9671accc4bcc692ac37e8197dc16f, by its author (Wynn), so the extension answers exactly as the dashboard's
MCP endpoint did. src/dashboard/UPSTREAM.json records each file's sha256. Everything else in src/ (the live WHOOP data
source, cache, rate limiting and the xaq host protocol) is new and replaces the dashboard's Postgres store, sync and
OAuth, which are not included.

